== Trivia ==
*In a forum post released by Hypixel, Jerry was revealed to be an immortal entity of infinite power. Apparently, the reason that he would sometimes duplicate was that they were struggling to contain his power and the dev team refused to fix it because they feared for their lives. The forum post mysteriously vanished within 5 minutes of it being posted.<!--
*The [[Aspect of the Jerry]] was a joke created by {{RN|yt|[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5p_l5ZeB_wGjO_yDXwiqvw {{red|TommyInnit}}]}}.-->
*Jerry tended to multiply before update v0.7.4, with many of them appearing at random on the Private Island. As of v0.7.4, all of them have played a "Battle Royale," according to {{RN|Admin|Jayavarmen}} in the [https://hypixel.net/threads/skyblock-patch-0-7-4.2430560/ patch notes], leaving only one Jerry on the private island. There is still a bug in which Jerry could occasionally duplicate, but it would be removed when traveling to another server.<!--
**The bug is still present, but after the first relog after duplication, the additional Jerry will despawn, with the note, "Your (number of extra Jerries) additional Jerries have packed their bags and left!".-->
*As an April Fool's joke, Jerry could move freely on [[Private Island|The Private Island]], all player skins changed to Jerry, and Move Jerrys had the description of the [[Quality Map]].
*Jerry was added in another Hypixel minigame, Bedwars, where one trades him Emeralds for Lucky Blocks.<!--
*Jerry was added as a [[Mayor Jerry|special mayor]] on 1/07/2021.-->
*If Jerry falls into the void, he will attempt to respawn in a safe location.

